{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：11:30 2026-06-29 HKT<br/>發佈時間：11:30 2026-06-29 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：11:30 2026-06-29 HKT</p><p>今(29日)早上7時48分，有途人發現一名男子在香港仔海傍道一公園對開離岸5米海面，載浮載沉，消防接報到場救起姓謝(54歲)男事主，惟他已陷昏迷，被送往瑪麗醫院搶救，惜最終不治。警方正調查事件。死因有待驗屍後確定。</p><img alt=\"現場為香港仔海濱公園對開海面。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/7d7a18155fd9d798150ca4be609af9c6/2026-06/WhatsApp_Image_2026-06-29_at_10_40_16.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/600fb791796df9a661de2b0ca19f7c88/2026-06/WhatsApp_Image_2026-06-29_at_10_40_15_1_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"54歲男子墮海送院不治。蔡楚輝攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/0d6a09cb345a18a0b64becd082ee9f84/2026-06/WhatsApp_Image_2026-06-29_at_10_40_14_2_.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/a4498a30bfab64ef8e6c8c3f72c53c97/2026-06/WhatsApp_Image_2026-06-29_at_10_40_14.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/e483811f70616f790eae3876e16b5cfe/2026-06/WhatsApp_Image_2026-06-29_at_10_40_13.jpeg\"/><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-06-29T03:41:49.409916+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":190,"images":5,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"unknown"}}